<ui:UXML xmlns:ui="UnityEngine.UIElements" xmlns:uie="UnityEditor.UIElements" xsi:schemaLocation="UnityEngine.UIElements ../../UIElementsSchema/UnityEngine.UIElements.xsd" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" editor-extension-mode="False">
    <Style src="project:/Assets/UI/Styles/GlobalStyles.uss" />
    <ui:VisualElement name="root" class="bg-gradient" style="flex-grow: 1; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 5%;">
        <!-- Logo Placeholder -->
        <ui:VisualElement name="logo" style="width: 50%; aspect-ratio: 1; background-color: white; border-radius: 40px; margin-bottom: 10%; justify-content: center; align-items: center;">
            <ui:Label text="PVP" style="color: #461A42; font-size: 80px; -unity-font-style: bold;" />
        </ui:VisualElement>
        
        <ui:Label name="status-label" text="DANG TAI DU LIEU..." style="color: white; font-size: 48px; margin-bottom: 30px; -unity-font-style: bold;" />
        
        <!-- Loading Bar -->
        <ui:VisualElement name="loading-bar-container" class="progress-container" style="width: 80%; height: 24px;">
            <ui:VisualElement name="loading-fill" class="progress-fill" style="width: 0%;" />
        </ui:VisualElement>
        <ui:Label name="progress-label" text="0%" style="color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7); font-size: 36px; margin-top: 15px;" />
    </ui:VisualElement>
</ui:UXML>
